%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:166 (writeXml-inlineCloseOn-test)
testing: inlineCloseOn never - always uses explicit close tags
元の形: io/writeXml の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write({"root": {"empty": {}}}, "application/xml", {"inlineCloseOn": "never"})
